@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Welcome to AlgoChat@Algoromida!";
}

<div>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <p>
                What is <strong>Dona</strong>?<br>
                Dona is an artificially cognitive prototype working at algoChat at algoromida as a social conversational chatbot. Dona's initial release was on 01/31/2019.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>
                What can <strong>Dona</strong> do?<br>
                Dona is mainly designed to engage in social and general conversations with humans. Dona can tell jokes on most subjects, you can try something along the line of: tell me a joke about snow OR tell me a joke on politics. Dona can search Wikipedia, try: search wikipedia for the olympics.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>
                What can't <strong>Dona</strong> do?<br>
                Dona can't help you accomplisihing a specific task such as reserving a hotel room or ordering food online.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>
                How can I interact with  <strong>Dona</strong>?<br>
                <a asp-controller="Algoromida" asp-action="Index" asp-route-botId="Dona">Click here to talk to Dona.</a>
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>
                When can I interact with  <strong>Dona</strong>?<br>
                You can chat with Dona right now, right here! As a matter of fact, you can chat with Dona anywhere and anytime as long as you have access to the internet and have a facebook account.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>
                How is artificial cognition different from artificial intelligence?<br>
                Cognition is based on attention, awareness, statefulness, and provocativeness; cognition is a prerequisite of any level of intelligence.
            </p>
        </li>

    </ul>
</div>

